<%- include("partials/header") %>
<main>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container page-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">About the lab</p>
      <h1>Independent testing support for Chhatrapati Sambhajinagar projects.</h1>
      <p>Qualitex Test House Chhatrapati Sambhajinagar Pvt. Ltd. provides quality-driven material testing support for public and private infrastructure work.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container split-layout">
      <div class="split-copy">
        <h2>Standards-led testing with practical project support.</h2>
        <p>Our quality system follows ISO/IEC 17025:2017 requirements, with methods aligned to relevant IS and ASTM standards. The lab combines in-house testing discipline with on-site sample collection support for teams that need reliable reports and responsive coordination.</p>
        
        <h3 style="margin-top: 32px; font-size: 1.6rem; color: #fff;">Our Story & Mission</h3>
        <p>Founded by a collective of civil engineering experts, Qualitex Test House was established to solve the biggest challenges in material testing today: the need for uncompromising precision combined with rapid turnaround times. We understand that in modern infrastructure, delays and inaccurate reporting can cost millions and compromise safety.</p>
        <p>Our mission is to empower construction, manufacturing, and infrastructure industries through technical excellence. By leveraging state-of-the-art calibrated machinery and rigorous adherence to NABL-accredited protocols, we ensure that every pile driven and every batch of concrete poured is backed by data you can absolutely trust.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <h3>Registered location</h3>
        <p><%= location %></p>
        <h3>Legal entity</h3>
        <p><%= labName %></p>
        <h3>Certificate</h3>
        <p><%= certificateNumber %> | Valid until <%= validUntil %></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
<%- include("partials/footer") %>
